### 544-empty-cart-rejected.http — [usecase-test] CASE-05. (Order) 빈 Cart에서는 Order를 생성할 수 없다
### https://github.com/prgrms-be-adv-devcourse/beadv7_7_earlybird_BE/issues/544

### 1. 후원자만 가입/로그인 (Cart를 비워둔 채로 바로 주문 시도)
< {% client.global.set("backerEmail", "ord544-backer-" + Date.now() + "@earlybird.co.kr"); %}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{backerEmail}}", "password": "rawPassword1!", "name": "544후원자", "phoneNumber": "010-1000-0009"}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 200, "signup failed"); %}

### 2.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{backerEmail}}", "password": "rawPassword1!"}

> {% client.global.set("backerAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken); client.global.set("userId", response.body.data.user.id); %}

### 3. Cart가 비어있는 상태에서 문법적으로 정상인 주문 요청 — 임의 rewardId(1)로 시도
< {% request.variables.set("orderIdempotencyKey", crypto.randomUUID()); %}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{backerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}}, "projectId": 1,
  "requests": [{"rewardId": 1, "quantity": 1, "expectedUnitPrice": 10000}],
  "receiverName": "Kim", "receiverPhone": "010-1111-2222", "shippingAddress": "Seoul", "zipCode": "01234",
  "expectedItemsAmount": 10000, "expectedTotalAmount": 13000,
  "orderIdempotencyKey": "{{orderIdempotencyKey}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("빈 Cart 주문 -> 409", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "expected 409, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
        client.assert(JSON.stringify(response.body).includes("Order Cart is empty"), "unexpected message: " + response.body);
    });
%}
